    "updated_at": "2019-04-17T16:56:46Z",
    "body": "@deviousasti, it really depends on the device you are trying to use the API to connect to. As mentioned above, devices implementing the USB serial protocol have always been difficult to use, which is why [webusb/arduino](https://github.com/webusb/arduino) provides a library to modify the interface into one that isn't claimed by the operating system's USB serial class drivers. The [Serial API](https://wicg.github.io/serial/) will help alleviate this problem by providing an API that works for USB (and other types of) serial devices.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
